# 🌐 Mangalam HDPE Pipes & Coils Website

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is a modern, responsive web application developed for **Mangalam HDPE Pipes & Coils**, a company specializing in industrial-grade piping solutions.

The website showcases premium HDPE products, technical specifications, manufacturing process, applications, and company information in a structured and professional layout.

The main goal of this project is to create a digital product presentation platform for industrial clients and customers.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 🧭 Sticky navigation header for quick access
- 🏭 Professional hero product showcase section
- 🖼️ Image gallery with interactive product display
- 📊 Technical specifications table
- ⚙️ Step-by-step manufacturing process section
- 💡 Highlighted product features (durability, flexibility, resistance, etc.)
- ❓ FAQ section with expandable answers
- 📩 Email capture form for catalogue requests
- 🚀 Applications across industries (water supply, chemical transport, agriculture, etc.)
- 🧪 Portfolio section for different piping solutions
- 📥 Resources & downloadable technical documents
- 📞 Lead generation / custom quote form
- 📌 Fully structured footer with company details

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5  
- CSS3  
- JavaScript  
- Responsive Web Design  
- UI/UX Layout Structuring  



